WEBVTT

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:22.055
Though you are so close,
Kore hodo soba ni

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:26.559
I cannot tell you how I feel.
Iru no ni tsutaerarezu

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:30.630
The more strongly I feel,
Tsuyoku omou hodo

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:35.235
the harder it is for me to find the words.
Kotoba ga mitsukaranai

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:43.276
What is sad is not fate...
Kanashii no wa unmei ja nakute

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:54.050
...but that all encounters come to an end.
Deai no subete ni owari ga aru koto

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:58.491
O incomplete beings,
Mikan naru mono

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:02.929
awaken, for beyond the night...
mezameyo yoru o koetara

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:07.000
At the end of the desert...
Sabaku no hate ni

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:14.668
...the truth surely awaits you.
Shinjitsu ga matteru yo kitto

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:36.329
Heat signature overhead!

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:36.886
Honoka!

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:38.254
I know.

00:01:38.631 --> 00:01:39.222
It's him!

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:50.170
"There you are," murmured Blue Breaker.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:54.848
At the same time, using the
artificial brain housed in steel,

00:01:54.848 --> 00:01:57.009
he pondered over his memories.

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:11.427
"Tonight, I can fight that one
without reserve," he murmured,

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:14.400
turning off his stealth coat, then on,

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.061
and then off again.

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:20.033
As if he could not suppress his excitement.

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:25.209
The Wind That Sweeps The Land

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:27.443
Miss Honoka?

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:29.412
Bogie, take care of these two for me.

00:02:30.116 --> 00:02:30.673
Hono!

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:34.482
You plan to go out like that?!
What about the PSP?!

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:35.451
No time!

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:42.058
Be calm!

00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:43.457
Be calm about this, Honoka!

00:02:44.097 --> 00:02:44.995
Where are you?

00:02:45.098 --> 00:02:46.497
Where are you?! Where are you?!

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:49.528
Show yourself, Blue Breaker!

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:58.206
Hono!

00:02:58.444 --> 00:03:00.708
Mr. Bogie, please let me off.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:01.869
What do you plan to do?

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:04.884
She doesn't even have full
use of her right hand yet.

00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:05.816
This is recklessness.

00:03:05.985 --> 00:03:07.543
I can't let you off.

00:03:07.654 --> 00:03:10.623
My orders from Honoka are to keep you safe.

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:13.893
I understand that you have
faith in Miss Honoka,

00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:16.794
but how can you remain so calm?!

00:03:17.597 --> 00:03:19.189
Because man must live.

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:20.257
What?

00:03:22.669 --> 00:03:25.661
Life always comes hand-in-hand with death.

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:30.305
If you ask me, Honoka is
merely fulfilling her duty.

00:03:31.244 --> 00:03:36.147
To live. To survive. She is merely
doing what is necessary.

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:42.021
And to support her in that endeavor...

00:03:42.021 --> 00:03:44.285
...in whatever small ways I can
is my job as her guardian.

00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:48.021
Did you come to that realization on your own?

00:03:48.127 --> 00:03:49.321
Is that so strange?

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:51.564
It's true, I'm a machine.

00:03:51.564 --> 00:03:53.233
I may be far removed...

00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:56.035
...from the concepts of life and
death as humans think of them.

00:03:56.035 --> 00:03:59.937
But I think that we are probably the same.

00:04:00.139 --> 00:04:00.764
The same?

00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:04.077
Everything that exists in this world
will vanish in its own time.

00:04:04.077 --> 00:04:07.069
Did the Great War distinguish
between humans and machines?

00:04:07.447 --> 00:04:12.252
History was lost, and Honoka and Millie
exist within our new history.

00:04:12.252 --> 00:04:13.412
As do I.

00:04:32.405 --> 00:04:33.201
Damn it!

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:36.431
She tried to feel for his presence,
but she was unable to grasp it.

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:38.578
The anger she could not fully suppress...

00:04:38.578 --> 00:04:40.773
...was robbing Honoka of her composure.

00:04:41.881 --> 00:04:45.840
Every time Blue Breaker's
bullets raised clouds of sand,

00:04:46.386 --> 00:04:50.345
she saw Zankan's death in her mind.

00:04:51.057 --> 00:04:52.158
She's going to get killed!

00:04:52.158 --> 00:04:54.794
Go back, Bogie! Back to Hono!

00:04:54.794 --> 00:04:58.161
Mr. Bogie, I have an agreement with you two.

00:04:58.865 --> 00:05:01.234
An agreement that I would
accompany Miss Honoka.

00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:05.038
I must always be with her!

00:05:05.038 --> 00:05:06.835
Please hold up your end of the agreement.

00:05:07.273 --> 00:05:09.537
If you're going to put it that way,
you leave me no choice.

00:05:11.344 --> 00:05:13.039
We will now head to back up Honoka.

00:05:13.279 --> 00:05:14.940
Does anyone have any objections?

00:05:18.985 --> 00:05:21.112
I have to hurry... I have to hurry!

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:24.624
Bogie!

00:05:24.624 --> 00:05:25.488
Catch!

00:05:31.831 --> 00:05:33.765
I love you, Bogie!

00:05:43.443 --> 00:05:45.172
GO!

00:06:02.428 --> 00:06:03.360
He's not there?!

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:17.009
Bastard... Pops' last...

00:06:17.276 --> 00:06:19.836
How dare you touch Pops' last piece of work?!

00:06:21.047 --> 00:06:22.571
Where are you? Where are you at?!

00:06:28.087 --> 00:06:30.317
I've had enough of you!

00:06:35.695 --> 00:06:38.831
Stay cool, Honoka! You have
a limited amount of ammo!

00:06:38.831 --> 00:06:39.991
Take this!

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:41.662
Take this! And this!

00:06:42.568 --> 00:06:48.131
In her rage, Honoka was unable to
fully utilize the PSP's capabilities.

00:06:49.242 --> 00:06:52.612
The fact she could not make the most
of this chance Bogie had given her...

00:06:52.612 --> 00:06:53.746
...was even more maddening to her.

00:06:53.746 --> 00:06:55.248
Take this! And this!
...was even more maddening to her.

00:06:55.248 --> 00:06:55.737
Take this! And this!

00:06:58.217 --> 00:06:58.911
Hono?!

00:07:00.286 --> 00:07:02.288
Calm down! Calm down, Honoka!

00:07:02.288 --> 00:07:03.550
Damn it!

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:07.387
Go down! Go down! Go down!

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:11.389
The ammo...

00:07:20.239 --> 00:07:21.103
It's no good...

00:07:21.574 --> 00:07:22.506
The legs...

00:07:43.729 --> 00:07:44.889
How long...

00:07:45.431 --> 00:07:47.661
How long do you have to play
around before you're satisfied?!

00:07:48.301 --> 00:07:49.029
You!

00:07:49.268 --> 00:07:49.893
It's you!

00:07:50.336 --> 00:07:52.896
Always acting like you're so superior!

00:07:53.372 --> 00:07:55.897
Thinking you can do whatever
you want with everything!

00:07:56.509 --> 00:07:58.909
But all you ever do is hide and fight dirty!

00:08:09.622 --> 00:08:10.418
Did she get him?

00:08:10.556 --> 00:08:11.853
She is not focused.

00:08:31.244 --> 00:08:32.302
You...

00:09:29.769 --> 00:09:31.168
Hono, can you hear me?!

00:09:32.371 --> 00:09:34.339
Hono, you can't die!

00:09:34.941 --> 00:09:36.033
Millie...

00:09:36.375 --> 00:09:38.434
I don't want you to die, Hono!

00:09:38.878 --> 00:09:40.368
Millie knows!

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:44.575
Even if you take that guy down,
it won't bring my father back.

00:09:45.818 --> 00:09:48.120
So, I want you instead!

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:50.145
I'd rather be with you, Hono!

00:09:51.824 --> 00:09:53.052
Millie...

00:11:21.347 --> 00:11:21.938
That's...

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:25.408
...a trnka.

00:11:30.556 --> 00:11:32.291
Do you not hear it?

00:11:32.291 --> 00:11:33.315
Miss Honoka's voice...

00:11:36.595 --> 00:11:39.432
"Though the night makes you gentle,"

00:11:39.432 --> 00:11:41.559
"You mustn't ever surrender."

00:11:42.301 --> 00:11:45.031
It's a poem. By Donna Myfree.

00:11:45.905 --> 00:11:48.107
"Nebulous memories of the past."

00:11:48.107 --> 00:11:49.972
"The future, yet to be determined."

00:11:50.209 --> 00:11:51.801
"The light of distant galaxies."

00:11:52.745 --> 00:11:54.713
"All a mirage before your eyes,"

00:11:55.081 --> 00:11:58.073
"For there is nothing that is certain."

00:12:06.859 --> 00:12:08.918
"You can pursue your dreams,"

00:12:09.462 --> 00:12:12.090
"Continue to pursue those
shapeless imaginings,"

00:12:12.498 --> 00:12:14.966
"And you can live upon this world."

00:12:23.175 --> 00:12:27.908
He could detect neither violence nor
hostility in the approaching Honoka,

00:12:28.748 --> 00:12:32.343
but he was struck by a sense of intimidation.

00:12:33.119 --> 00:12:35.519
Was this what he should call "fear"?

00:12:36.055 --> 00:12:37.386
He hesitated.

00:12:47.066 --> 00:12:49.432
You can understand words, right?

00:12:53.339 --> 00:12:54.271
Go.

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:57.534
Right now, I'm not in the
mood to cut down anyone.

00:12:58.344 --> 00:13:00.437
Not even you.

00:13:23.702 --> 00:13:26.068
Thank you, Millie.

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:52.620
Where...

00:14:03.742 --> 00:14:04.936
Iks...

00:14:13.419 --> 00:14:16.718
I couldn't avenge Pops.

00:14:17.623 --> 00:14:20.057
You chose not to.

00:14:20.759 --> 00:14:23.159
I think that's what Millie wanted as well.

00:14:24.029 --> 00:14:26.327
Is it okay for me to believe that?

00:14:27.066 --> 00:14:27.930
Yes.

00:14:30.736 --> 00:14:32.829
It feels so nice here!

00:14:33.539 --> 00:14:34.563
I understand now.

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:35.972
What?

00:14:36.242 --> 00:14:39.302
You're the one showing me this, aren't you?

00:14:39.678 --> 00:14:41.805
With your healing powers.

00:14:42.348 --> 00:14:44.339
This is the memory of the land.

00:14:44.783 --> 00:14:46.614
Memory of the land?

00:14:47.286 --> 00:14:51.780
Bogie said that everything that
exists in this world will vanish.

00:14:52.658 --> 00:14:58.187
That you and Millie and Bogie
exist in this new world.

00:15:01.333 --> 00:15:03.233
I believe it is just as he said.

00:15:03.936 --> 00:15:07.963
Even if this new history also slips into the past,

00:15:08.107 --> 00:15:11.210
as long as there is someone
to retrace those memories...

00:15:11.210 --> 00:15:14.413
Whether that be a man,
or some other living creature,

00:15:14.413 --> 00:15:15.744
or even a machine...

00:15:16.715 --> 00:15:19.151
As long as there is someone
to retrace those memories,

00:15:19.151 --> 00:15:21.642
there will always be a future there.

00:15:22.321 --> 00:15:23.117
Yeah.

00:15:24.023 --> 00:15:30.155
No matter how the land changes,
the wind here sweeps toward the future.

00:15:31.297 --> 00:15:34.460
There is no future that is cut off
from memories of the past.

00:15:36.535 --> 00:15:40.528
Miss Honoka, you may not be one of The Third,

00:15:41.073 --> 00:15:44.065
but you are hardly a might-have-been.

00:15:45.144 --> 00:15:46.512
Perhaps you yourself...

00:15:46.512 --> 00:15:49.504
...are a part of the new history
that is linked to the past.

00:15:50.783 --> 00:15:53.752
I don't really understand,

00:15:54.286 --> 00:15:56.186
but it just means I'm me, right?

00:15:56.755 --> 00:15:57.915
I suppose so.

00:15:58.157 --> 00:15:59.886
Hono!

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:02.427
Hono!

00:16:02.695 --> 00:16:03.753
Millie...

00:16:04.196 --> 00:16:05.686
Hono!

00:16:06.565 --> 00:16:07.759
Shall we go back?

00:16:08.167 --> 00:16:09.566
Millie is calling.

00:16:10.336 --> 00:16:11.030
Yeah.

00:16:14.073 --> 00:16:14.971
Hono?!

00:16:15.341 --> 00:16:16.171
Hono!

00:16:16.842 --> 00:16:17.774
Hono!

00:16:21.914 --> 00:16:22.903
Millie...

00:16:23.148 --> 00:16:25.844
Thank goodness! Hono...

00:16:27.386 --> 00:16:30.253
I told you, didn't I?! Don't leave me alone!

00:16:30.789 --> 00:16:34.054
I don't want to lose someone again.

00:16:34.727 --> 00:16:36.558
I don't want that!

00:16:37.496 --> 00:16:41.296
It's okay, Millie. It's okay now.

00:16:41.533 --> 00:16:42.898
Hono...

00:16:57.716 --> 00:16:58.876
Joganki!

00:16:59.685 --> 00:17:01.414
You needn't be so happy to see me.

00:17:01.754 --> 00:17:04.587
Was he your doing?!

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:08.050
Was it you that sent that murderous puppet?!

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:10.289
What if it was?

00:17:10.763 --> 00:17:11.821
I won't forgive you!

00:17:12.231 --> 00:17:15.792
I see the mood is not very
conducive for witty remarks.

00:17:16.301 --> 00:17:18.292
Even within The Third, there are factions.

00:17:18.837 --> 00:17:21.840
Even in the matter of how
to handle Technos Taboo,

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:24.443
the opinions range from the
extreme to the moderate.

00:17:24.443 --> 00:17:26.308
And that is also true for
how to handle that person.

00:17:26.945 --> 00:17:28.242
That person?

00:17:28.647 --> 00:17:32.451
That person is the first official
contact we have had...

00:17:32.451 --> 00:17:34.919
...with an intelligent life form
that is alien to our planet.

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:39.990
Honoka felt no surprise.

00:17:41.060 --> 00:17:43.688
It was something she had
vaguely come to realize.

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:46.595
Though, it was not something
she wanted to know.

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:55.170
I cannot understand why you
have come to visit this planet.

00:17:55.407 --> 00:17:57.932
What your purpose is.

00:17:58.677 --> 00:18:00.838
And you are here to ask me that?

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:04.583
To ask and to deal with matters
accordingly based on your response.

00:18:04.583 --> 00:18:06.050
That is my mission.

00:18:06.485 --> 00:18:09.113
I am very sorry. At this time...

00:18:09.388 --> 00:18:12.721
You will let us know in due time?
Is that what that means?

00:18:13.058 --> 00:18:15.856
In due time, I believe you will find out.

00:18:16.462 --> 00:18:20.228
I never expected that you
would answer to begin with.

00:18:21.567 --> 00:18:22.693
I understand.

00:18:23.001 --> 00:18:24.593
I will not rush the matter.

00:18:24.803 --> 00:18:27.033
I shall wait until you are willing.

00:18:27.506 --> 00:18:29.701
You are fine with that?

00:18:30.008 --> 00:18:35.537
You have the trust of someone that I trust, so...

00:18:44.123 --> 00:18:47.354
I am honored that you would take
the trouble of seeing me off.

00:18:47.626 --> 00:18:50.151
Well, I've got time to kill anyway.

00:18:50.429 --> 00:18:54.160
And it looks like you didn't
seduce Iks to your cause, so...

00:18:54.533 --> 00:18:57.764
That is not to say I have
given up on seducing you.

00:18:58.203 --> 00:19:00.433
You're so popular, Hono.

00:19:00.873 --> 00:19:01.362
Hey!

00:19:01.874 --> 00:19:03.742
You may not believe it, but...

00:19:03.742 --> 00:19:05.471
Nope, I'm not gonna believe.

00:19:06.044 --> 00:19:09.639
By no means is your power
the only thing I desire.

00:19:09.882 --> 00:19:11.076
I want you to understand that.

00:19:11.416 --> 00:19:12.178
Huh?

00:19:12.518 --> 00:19:14.042
I am not repeating myself.

00:19:28.867 --> 00:19:31.836
Lucky him! He flew away.

00:19:32.337 --> 00:19:35.067
Why not ask to ride along with next time?

00:19:35.140 --> 00:19:37.404
If it's with him, no thanks.

00:19:38.844 --> 00:19:39.970
Shall we go back?

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:42.339
Iks.

00:19:43.115 --> 00:19:43.740
Yes?

00:19:44.483 --> 00:19:46.747
Are you... well...

00:19:48.654 --> 00:19:49.951
Oh, nevermind.

00:19:50.355 --> 00:19:51.151
It's nothing.

00:19:53.759 --> 00:19:55.158
That was unexpected.

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:57.394
That you would go in person.

00:19:58.864 --> 00:20:00.354
Been monitoring me the whole way, have you?

00:20:00.666 --> 00:20:02.134
Your exertion is appreciated, I'm sure.

00:20:02.134 --> 00:20:05.433
Is it all right to leave him free and unchecked?

00:20:05.904 --> 00:20:08.532
It means we must not touch
him for the time being.

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:09.572
Let us wait.

00:20:09.708 --> 00:20:10.640
Wait?

00:20:10.842 --> 00:20:11.536
Yes.

00:20:11.944 --> 00:20:17.814
Wait to see what he will see, where
he will go, and what he will think.

00:20:18.784 --> 00:20:21.446
If that is the decision you
have made, I will comply.

00:20:21.887 --> 00:20:24.014
Though, I will not be responsible
if you regret it later.

00:20:25.724 --> 00:20:28.818
It seems you are never satisfied
unless you say your piece.

00:20:29.328 --> 00:20:31.990
I will take this opportunity to
tell you something as well.

00:20:32.764 --> 00:20:33.560
What might that be?

00:20:34.233 --> 00:20:35.200
Honoka is...

00:20:35.734 --> 00:20:39.670
At the very least, she is not anything
like what you think her to be.

00:20:40.239 --> 00:20:43.140
In that case, is she human?

00:20:43.408 --> 00:20:44.170
Or?

00:20:44.643 --> 00:20:45.735
Who knows?

00:20:46.144 --> 00:20:49.739
At any rate, we and humans are the same.

00:20:49.948 --> 00:20:51.850
In the sense that none of us know...

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:54.546
...where we are born from,
nor where we are headed.

00:21:02.027 --> 00:21:05.258
"O man, as thy dream dictates,"

00:21:05.831 --> 00:21:07.492
"Let us depart on a journey tonight."

00:21:07.733 --> 00:21:08.597
What?

00:21:09.568 --> 00:21:10.967
How did you know that?

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:12.860
It is a splendid poem.

00:21:13.238 --> 00:21:14.603
Bogie taught it to me.

00:21:15.107 --> 00:21:16.335
Bogie did?

00:21:17.042 --> 00:21:19.169
It's apparently one of
his favorite poems as well.

00:21:19.544 --> 00:21:21.136
That Bogie...

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:25.641
"O man, as thy dream dictates,"

00:21:26.184 --> 00:21:28.414
"Let us depart on a journey tonight."
"Let us depart on a journey tonight."

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:34.982
"Guided by the breath of
the stars, the clear breeze,"
"Guided by the breath of
the stars, the clear breeze,"

00:21:35.193 --> 00:21:38.094
"And the blessing of the children of the night."
"And the blessing of the children of the night."

00:21:38.563 --> 00:21:40.394
"No matter where you travel,"
"No matter where you travel,"

00:21:40.532 --> 00:21:43.558
"There will be no end to the
tomorrows you arrive at."
"There will be no end to the
tomorrows you arrive at."

00:21:44.903 --> 00:21:47.906
A flexible civilization...
Juunan na bunmei wa

00:21:47.906 --> 00:21:50.409
...is always rapidly advancing.
Itsudatte nisshin-geppo

00:21:50.409 --> 00:21:53.378
You and your dreams are also...
Kimi to yume mo

00:21:53.378 --> 00:21:57.178
...making headway even now.
Genzai shinkou

00:22:02.721 --> 00:22:05.691
I realized for the first time...
Hajimete kizuitan da

00:22:05.691 --> 00:22:09.388
...with that line, resembling a surprise attack.
Fui-uchi ni nita sono serifu de

00:22:14.433 --> 00:22:17.369
My sixth sense was pried open.
Kojiakerareta dai-rokkan

00:22:17.369 --> 00:22:21.396
I'd been waiting for this feeling this whole time.
Kono kankaku o zutto matteita

00:22:25.410 --> 00:22:28.380
Opening my heart, just opening it...
Kokoro o hiraite tada hiraite

00:22:28.380 --> 00:22:31.350
I embrace the voices of strangers.
Daisansha no koe ukeireru

00:22:31.350 --> 00:22:34.219
Earnestly persevering, just persevering...
Hitasura koraete tada koraete

00:22:34.219 --> 00:22:37.313
I even try turning pages of criticism.
Hinan no peeji mo aketemiru

00:22:37.622 --> 00:22:40.592
I'm going to leave my...
Toushindai no boku wa

00:22:40.592 --> 00:22:43.459
...true-to-life self behind, right here.
Koko ni oite iku yo

00:22:43.528 --> 00:22:47.332
You can say whatever you want now...
Mou nanto itte kuretemo

00:22:47.332 --> 00:22:48.856
...and I'm fine with that.
Kekkou da

00:22:49.368 --> 00:22:54.840
Ah, how simple is the impulse to evolve.
Aa nante tanjun da shinka shitai to iu shoudou

00:22:54.840 --> 00:22:57.776
You and your dreams are also...
Kimi to yume mo

00:22:57.776 --> 00:23:00.973
...making headway even now.
Genzai shinkou

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:16.755
Preview

00:23:17.095 --> 00:23:19.290
Having said goodbye to Millie,

00:23:19.431 --> 00:23:22.628
Bogie and I were spending our first
lonely desert night in a while.

00:23:22.901 --> 00:23:24.562
The circumstance that we encountered there...

00:23:24.836 --> 00:23:28.704
...was a fight of survival
between armored ants.

00:23:29.374 --> 00:23:32.639
In this deadly conflict that reflected
the harshness of nature,

00:23:32.778 --> 00:23:36.714
I spent a trying night, simply
waiting for morning to come.

00:23:37.716 --> 00:23:40.952
Next time on
The Third - The Girl With The Blue Eye,

00:23:40.952 --> 00:23:41.920
episode 7, "Until Dawn".

00:23:41.920 --> 00:23:43.288
Until Dawn
episode 7, "Until Dawn".

00:23:43.288 --> 00:23:44.778
Until Dawn
